  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Due to concerns about leaks, many creators have transitioned to using uploads only, often utilizing third-party software or systems. The VCC should include an option that ensures safety for both creators and users who need to upload content, such as those without a PC or those with low-end PCs that cannot handle uploads. I propose that the VCC front page or VRChat website incorporate an uploading system where users can provide or receive codes to enable creators using the VCC to upload purchased content directly to the user's account. Additionally, it would be beneficial to add a feature that disables the ability to change uploaded models from private to public. This would prevent users from violating the creator's terms of service by setting the model to public after upload.",
